   "source": [
    "### 4.6.2 Model Performance Analysis - Cost Curves\n",
    "\n",
    "Visualize classifier performance across all class distributions and misclassification costs using **cost curves** (Drummond & Holte, 2006).\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Cost Curve**: Shows Normalized Expected Cost (NC) vs Probability Cost (PC)\n",
    "- **Lower is better**: AUCC (Area Under Cost Curve) summarizes performance\n",
    "- **Trading-specific**: Maps risk/reward ratios to cost ratios"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
