      "\n",
      "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "AUCC Comparison (Area Under Cost Curve - lower is better):\n",
      "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "\u2b50 1. Primary Model       : AUCC = 0.2216\n",
      "   2. Baseline (Prior)    : AUCC = 0.2499\n",
      "\n",
      "\u2713 Best model: Primary Model\n",
      "\n",
      "Plotting cost curve difference...\n"
     ]
    },
    {
